  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I'm not sure if this is the only way to trigger this issue, which I've run into a number of times now, but my steps to reproduce consistently are:\nStep 1: Connect to the site and log in.\nStep 2: Change networks on your computer (move from ethernet to Wifi, or a different Wifi connection, or even to a mobile hotspot)\nStep 3: Refresh the page\nThen you end up being displayed this message, which I assume is just the raw JSON that should be being handled somewhere. Refreshing from here just keeps you on this error message, so to get back to the functional site you have to go back to hello.vrchat.com and log in again from there.",
